  <div class="container">
    <p class="section__eyebrow">MIDI MOB COLLECTIVE · LOWER HYBRID</p>
    <h1 class="section__title">Lower Hybrid</h1>
    <p class="section__body">Shane and Kaleb Wynn — Synth pop, electro punk and post rock projected through a lo-fi DIY lens. Analog hardware synths and drum machines create a grimy, yet psychedelic garage aesthetic. Minimalist, yet paradoxically expansive. From Birmingham, Alabama.</p>
    <p style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
      <a href="https://lowerhybrid.bandcamp.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--accent-cold);">Bandcamp</a> ·
      <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@lowerhybrid" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--accent-cold);">YouTube</a>
    </p>
    <a href="/collective.html" class="download" style="margin-top: 1.5rem; display: inline-block;">← Back to Collective</a>
  </div>
</section>

